f Japanese tea drinks" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="960" height="640"><span class="journey-intent-copy"><small>SOMETHING TO SIP</small><strong>Japanese drinks</strong><span>Tea, coffee and soft drinks: discover the names on the shelf.</span><b class="everyday-read">Read the story <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></b></span></a><a class="journey-intent-card journey-intent-cloudy everyday-card" href="./beer-on-shinkansen.html" data-article="beer"><img src="../images/beer/20261004-beer-hero-michikusa.webp" alt="Japanese beer for a journey" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="960" height="640"><span class="journey-intent-copy"><small>MEET THE BREWERS</small><strong>Japanese beer</strong><span>Find a lager for your journey and meet the breweries along the railway.</span><b class="everyday-read">Read the story <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></b></span></a></div></section><section id="countryside" class="everyday-section" aria-labelledby="country-title"><p class="eyebrow">02 · EVERYDAY COUNTRYSIDE</p><h2 id="country-title">Look at the landscape between the cities.</h2><p class="everyday-section-lead">Fields, green waves and pale roofs: ordinary things with stories of their own.</p><div class="everyday-grid country-grid"><a class="journey-intent-card journey-intent-cloudy everyday-card" href="countryside.html" data-article="countryside"><img src="../images/20260629_omi_fuji_michikusa.jpg" alt="Green rice fields below Mount Mikami in Shiga" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="960" height="640"><span class="journey-intent-copy"><small>FROM YOUR WINDOW</small><strong>Japan’s countryside, from your window</strong><span>Rice paddies, open fields, tea gardens and silver greenhouse roofs.</span><b class="everyday-read">Read the story <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></b></span></a><a class="journey-intent-card journey-intent-cloudy everyday-card" href="./spots/gamagori-greenhouses.html" data-article="greenhouses"><img src="../images/20260924_gamagori-greenhouses_